    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27166" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοϊστεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shoot an arrow between,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅς κε . . διοϊστεύσῃ πελέκεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.578
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί κεν διοϊστεύσειας</span> thou
			mightest <i>reach it with an arrow,</i> i. e. thou art but a
			bow-shot from it, <i><span class="en">
				12.102
			</span></i>.</div>
